{"kind":"rss","id":"wxmp:channel:zhihuribao","title":"知乎日报","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5MDM4MDExNQ==&mid=2832658572&idx=1&sn=2406d8a581eb305251803a586265deb3&chksm=8aa6b6a7baca176670bcb6814147ca0ce4151f33c2db30ad43193876c1743773d7f5da896a9d&scene=126&sessionid=1795011830#rd","description":"知乎官方订阅号，每日精选知乎热门、有趣内容","language":"zh-cn","extra":{"view":"timeline","show_thumbnails":true,"proxy_images":true,"headers":{"referer":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"tags":["微信公众号"]},"author":{"name":"知乎日报","uri":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx.qlogo.cn%2Fmmhead%2FUOCHvzUGAIWg6z2Qs1yTHicbpqJwAUFRtJ5nhXPMb35XhGb6OESOg9OianbhYibThkZQiclOv5GN4z8%2F0","updated":"2026-11-18T14:07:46.000Z","items":[{"id":"wxmp:MjM5MDM4MDExNQ%3D%3D:2832658572:1","title":"🥚 为什么豆包画不对 13 个鸡蛋？","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5MDM4MDExNQ==&mid=2832658572&idx=1&sn=2406d8a581eb305251803a586265deb3&chksm=8aa6b6a7baca176670bcb6814147ca0ce4151f33c2db30ad43193876c1743773d7f5da896a9d&scene=126&sessionid=1795011830#rd","description":"许久不见的<a class=\"wx_topic_link\" topic-id=\"mwm71io8-2gnkvc\" style=\"color: var(--weui-LINK) !important;\" data-topic=\"1\" data-recommend=\"0\">#刁难大模型</a> 系列终于又有更新[旺柴]\n\n有网友让豆包生成一盒装着 13 个鸡蛋的图片，结果尝试十几次，数量依然不准确。\n\n这是为什么？\n\n知乎答主 黄河边儿 解释，这与图像生成模型的工作方式有关：AI 更擅长学习和生成视觉特征，而不是像人一样先数清数量、再逐个绘制。\n\n🤔看起来简单的计数任务，对图像生成 AI 来说，反而可能是个难题。\n\n你还遇到过哪些 AI 无法做到的简单任务？","content":"<p>许久不见的<a class=\"wx_topic_link\" style=\"color: #576b95;\">#刁难大模型</a> 系列终于又有更新[旺柴]<br /><br />有网友让豆包生成一盒装着 13 个鸡蛋的图片，结果尝试十几次，数量依然不准确。<br /><br />这是为什么？<br /><br />知乎答主 黄河边儿 解释，这与图像生成模型的工作方式有关：AI 更擅长学习和生成视觉特征，而不是像人一样先数清数量、再逐个绘制。<br /><br />🤔看起来简单的计数任务，对图像生成 AI 来说，反而可能是个难题。<br /><br />你还遇到过哪些 AI 无法做到的简单任务？</p>\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FkrSqjDRWFlHE8EtROMwiabR5X51lS4zhYQkpz4TjAG7blGS7YJv2xbkZSS1ibMrmx77SUb2iceJ7uuyzpy2BA0vVKtGq2hN1fsoGXAesD6el8Y%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FkrSqjDRWFlGkFiaNtnStnOfyDPwibOGiblXMgrGLVATqvCQiaDcyNckrvj5icOeUtwQ6C3noFuj1liafdI8kgxnFOLN1Cdia4EFJkVicbMWuwpVuSyo%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","images":["http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FkrSqjDRWFlHE8EtROMwiabR5X51lS4zhYQkpz4TjAG7blGS7YJv2xbkZSS1ibMrmx77SUb2iceJ7uuyzpy2BA0vVKtGq2hN1fsoGXAesD6el8Y%2F0"],"type":"gallery","published":"2026-11-18T14:07:46.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MjM5MDM4MDExNQ%3D%3D:2832658560:1","title":"要是能把自己的爱好做成网页，你会做什么？","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5MDM4MDExNQ==&mid=2832658560&idx=1&sn=1b2c61f7f15e1245ed9c8cbd1df24903&chksm=8afe94e1a400fa5ab55f96d8e3f83b62d8a6e1ed8ed2197ee48f2809cad43fcacb0d97e91217&scene=126&sessionid=1795011830#rd","description":"喜欢钓鱼，就做个调漂模拟器。加一点铅、换个饵，看看浮漂会露出几目。人还没到水边，手已经练上了。🎣\n\n喜欢猫，就做个 PolyCat。随手画个多边形，看看它会长成一只什么样的小猫。喜欢青花瓷，就去「一笔成器」画一笔，在屏幕上烧出自己的瓷器。\n\n还有些点子，光听就想点进去试试：\n\n背《伤寒论》背得头大？干脆做成「抓大鹅」，在一堆药材里找出自己要的那几味，凑成书里的方子。\n\n堵车时总想「这路换个修法会不会好点」？去「堵车实验室」改一段路，看看车流到底怎么变。\n\n读《奥德赛》时想看看故事里的古希腊？点开绘本里的航线，走进 3D 场景逛逛建筑。\n\n👉 左滑看项目，扫海报上的二维码就能体验。也欢迎来知乎「AI Works 项目广场」发布自己的作品。\n\n如果今天就开做，你想把哪个爱好做成网页？评论区说说。\n\n<a class=\"wx_topic_link\" topic-id=\"mwlr88zm-qjghgd\" style=\"color: #576B95 !important;\" data-topic=\"1\" data-recommend=\"\">#知乎</a> <a class=\"wx_topic_link\" topic-id=\"mwlr88zm-wxp5nf\" style=\"color: #576B95 !important;\" data-topic=\"1\" data-recommend=\"\">#AIWorks</a> <a class=\"wx_topic_link\" topic-id=\"mwlr88zm-z5wckd\" style=\"color: #576B95 !important;\" data-topic=\"1\" data-recommend=\"\">#VibeCoding</a>","content":"<p>喜欢钓鱼，就做个调漂模拟器。加一点铅、换个饵，看看浮漂会露出几目。人还没到水边，手已经练上了。🎣<br /><br />喜欢猫，就做个 PolyCat。随手画个多边形，看看它会长成一只什么样的小猫。喜欢青花瓷，就去「一笔成器」画一笔，在屏幕上烧出自己的瓷器。<br /><br />还有些点子，光听就想点进去试试：<br /><br />背《伤寒论》背得头大？干脆做成「抓大鹅」，在一堆药材里找出自己要的那几味，凑成书里的方子。<br /><br />堵车时总想「这路换个修法会不会好点」？去「堵车实验室」改一段路，看看车流到底怎么变。<br /><br />读《奥德赛》时想看看故事里的古希腊？点开绘本里的航线，走进 3D 场景逛逛建筑。<br /><br />👉 左滑看项目，扫海报上的二维码就能体验。也欢迎来知乎「AI Works 项目广场」发布自己的作品。<br /><br />如果今天就开做，你想把哪个爱好做成网页？评论区说说。<br /><br /><a class=\"wx_topic_link\" style=\"color: #576b95;\">#知乎</a> <a class=\"wx_topic_link\" style=\"color: #576b95;\">#AIWorks</a> <a class=\"wx_topic_link\" style=\"color: #576b95;\">#VibeCoding</a></p>\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FkrSqjDRWFlF6872udibEAAFAu17MAQgIEMLP4f2ZGQ3yxKQr1GVSIeB0XWzPXwmY8QfkuznpueiaRtvtwG5S4zpLRIRkcfhPHkUVAnibj5hMNs%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FkrSqjDRWFlEQWV2kcicwFaKzrH4GSibI7rBd7kL0XdpxtVmh5icSopl7RcveYbVY3dHM53BGiaYXqJFd4VXdbk7zVEiamP5xMo7W4hxDNbaDr0Qw%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FkrSqjDRWFlE6ibzA2hPoWFSRmt0kDtpawiaGhVkJNI7c5Okkias2CJW39d6YeSJEhzj0u4JVF2Rwubticswp81SJbm3JUGzcorHXIHSbNLHYjib4%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FkrSqjDRWFlFGjB3dYVSz0U9SoZ5y8Qzp4LoQjUReMecdeHuZIEIq6JxGmPQhx66heyITZnTUjrldq705cpWEJAh2TliaeZ893icia2gNHBBicj4%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FkrSqjDRWFlHBzstia7Uxb7eNMPoKE2E5tLhSnaRNjrhicv4ucHianxuhnwxIJgFYBZibFJ7ueMHBllWBiaeCiaEBh0fY7vAFnKfO7rhicZF6apV7ias%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FkrSqjDRWFlFjCaknKnMtzWOgQZ7SwabpWZ5l05WtzS5244ibCZmm4TPn0icrtZibjJicVRDadBUkfQuqbUGu0CNgiakSZhAyuHick32ofiblVCWh5g%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FkrSqjDRWFlG0GCPZFdtiaibLWMy34yM1bjEficD3mticlA8LzvB4nFX9gRcE